    "extract": "The SKA Stadium or Stadion SKA is a multi-purpose stadium in Lviv, Ukraine. It is located in the Lviv neighborhood Klepariv, which was a suburb that is now part of the city center. The stadium is part of a bigger sports complex for summer sports, which belongs to the Ukrainian Ministry of Defense. The stadium is used often for football matches, and was the home of Karpaty Lviv reserve teams and FC Lviv. The stadium holds 23,040 spectators.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>SKA Stadium</b> or <b>Stadion SKA</b> is a multi-purpose stadium in Lviv, Ukraine. It is located in the Lviv neighborhood Klepariv, which was a suburb that is now part of the city center. The stadium is part of a bigger sports complex for summer sports, which belongs to the Ukrainian Ministry of Defense. The stadium is used often for football matches, and was the home of Karpaty Lviv reserve teams and FC Lviv. The stadium holds 23,040 spectators.</p>"
